# Graphify scope: index this repo's SOURCE only.
#
# Measured on the first two builds: without this file, 1112 of 1447 indexed
# files (77%) were .planning/ phase docs, and an incremental pass then pulled in
# 489 files of vendored GSD under .claude/ plus .vice-supervisor/ broker state —
# 24526 nodes / 20MB of mostly non-architecture. The graph exists to answer
# cross-file seam questions ("who consumes hostpath.ts"); phase history is served
# by SUMMARY.md / extract-learnings instead.
#
# NOTE: `graphify update` is INCREMENTAL and merges into the existing graph.
# Adding an ignore rule does not retroactively drop nodes — delete graphify-out/
# and rebuild to get a clean graph.

# GSD process artifacts
/.planning/

# Vendored, gitignored tool installs (not this project's code)
/.claude/
/.agents/
/.codex/
/.gsd/

# Runtime state, not source
/.vice-supervisor/

# Graphify's own output
/graphify-out/

# Generated license aggregation — no architectural signal
/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md

# Deployed copies of src/mcp/vice/resources/*.mjs (install-resources writes these
# into the consuming project). Indexing them duplicates every launcher node.
/tools/

# Local, gitignored artifacts
/.vice-snapshots/
/.vscode/
